            </note>
            <note corresp="#d745-f4" n="53" xml:id="d745-f4-content">
                <p>The remainder of the Argentine statement omitted here was withdrawn by the
                    Minister for Foreign Affairs in a note reported in Embassy’s telegram No. 122,
                    August 6, 1 p.m., not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d745-f5" n="54" xml:id="d745-f5-content">
                <p>Despatch No. 1688, July 30, not printed.</p>
            </note>
